            "review_text": "Qtime82\nNewcastle upon Tyne, United Kingdom302 contributions\n0\nTerrible\nAug 2016\nI ordered 1 steak (well done) And 2 chicken dishes plain by the time I walked from the counter to my seat my food had arrived, so great service but come on it take more than 30 seconds to cook a well done steak. It was dripping with blood. Had random things in the chicken dish that were not on the menu, raw mushrooms and onions which my daughter hates as they were sizzling they were stuck to the platter. The place was clean and tidy and staff were efficient but food wasn't very nice at all esp for the price I have ate outside the mall much better for much cheaper. Wouldn't return and wouldn't advise trying!\nRead more\nWritten August 12, 2016",
